{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 0cm;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey rear extension,\r\nin conjunction with the gable end and large rear dormer roof extensions, would\r\nintroduce an incongruous, overly dominant and obtrusive form of development\r\nthat would fail to respect the form and proportions of the existing\r\ndwellinghouse, and the character and appearance of the neighbouring properties,\r\nto the detriment of the character and appearance of the existing dwellinghouse\r\nand the surrounding area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy D3.D (1) and (11) of The\r\nLondon Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy\r\nDM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the\r\nadopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 0cm;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of the poor and\r\ncramped layout of the ground floor flat , poor outlook to living\r\nspaces for the flat and the failure to demonstrate adequate internal GIA for double bedrooms in both the ground and first floors flats, resulting in a poor standard of\r\nliving accommodation for future occupiers of those flats, to the detriment of\r\ntheir residential amenities,&amp;nbsp; contrary to\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies D6 and D3 (D.7 and D.10) of The London Plan (2021), Policies DM1 and DM26 of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan (2013), The Mayor of London Housing Supplementary Planning Guidance (2016), the\r\nadopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and\r\nHousing Design Standards LPG (2023).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
